## Results

**Service Name: `AIService`**

The Transcribe RPC is defined in `/bench/repo/proto/api/v1/ai_service.proto` and is exposed by the **`AIService`** service.

The RPC definition is on line 13:
```protobuf
rpc Transcribe(TranscribeRequest) returns (TranscribeResponse) {
  option (google.api.http) = {
    post: "/api/v1/ai:transcribe"
    body: "*"
  };
  option (google.api.method_signature) = "audio";
}
```

The Transcribe RPC accepts a `TranscribeRequest` message (containing audio input) and returns a `TranscribeResponse` message (containing the transcribed text).

